{"title":"TECH","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Tech Collection blends luxury and innovation in every detail. From premium audio to advanced smart devices, each piece is crafted for those who appreciate sophistication and performance. More than just functional, these products elevate your lifestyle and reflect true authenticity. Experience the world of Datum Dahleez—where technology meets timeless style.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-e-scooter-10-max-blue","title":"Datum Dahleez E-SCOOTER 10\" MAX BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Datum Dahleez E-Scooter 10\" Max, designed to enhance daily urban mobility and offer consumers a taste of Datum Dahleez's unwavering dedication to top-tier design and state-of-the-art technology.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344081592667,"sku":"BG-EU-10-501-AB","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/e39_1_f074610d-085e-47aa-b7e7-0afd73f9e0db.jpg?v=1742416441"},{"product_id":"Datum Dahleez-e-scooter-10-max-black","title":"Datum Dahleez E-SCOOTER 10\" MAX BLACK","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Datum Dahleez E-Scooter 10\" Max, designed to enhance daily urban mobility and offer consumers a taste of Datum Dahleez's unwavering dedication to top-tier design and state-of-the-art technology.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344082018651,"sku":"BG-EU-10-500-BK","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/e21_ae6ec6c0-41ac-4793-b26d-26f9c1db8b4f.jpg?v=1742416440"},{"product_id":"wireless-active-noise-cancelling-headphones-in-nocturne-and-lake-blue","title":"WIRELESS ACTIVE NOISE CANCELLING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 LAKE BLUE","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThe Datum Dahleez Wireless Headphones offer a blend of functionality and style, in a lightweight anodized aluminium, durable tempered glass, and soft lambskin leather promote longer wear in a sleek, luxurious finish. Boasting replaceable memory foam ear pads and a felted hard shell travel case to provide additional comfort and protection on-the-go. With angled ear cups fine-tuned for an even wider soundstage, the custom 40mm Beryllium coated drivers evenly distribute our expansive, signature sound in the form of warmer lows and richer highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eAdaptive Active Noise Cancelling automatically adjusts the level of noise cancellation to match your surroundings, leaving behind nothing but the sound you want. Enjoy up to 32 hours of total battery life or up to 28 hours with Active Noise Cancellation enabled. For optimal battery usage, proximity sensors allow for on-head detection to auto-pause your Datum Dahleez Wireless Headphones, so you get the most out of your listening time.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344110297435,"sku":"MW75BGT2","price":750.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a5_cc75c4f5-525e-4b20-bde7-abff9432682f.jpg?v=1742416376"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-nocturne-and-jet-orange","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 JET ORANGE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344130777435,"sku":"MG20BGT1","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a18_22942621-1bb4-478c-b523-5bcd7fa57f71.jpg?v=1742416362"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-blanc-and-deep-blue","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN BLANC \u0026 DEEP BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344131924315,"sku":"MG20BGT3","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a14_1_9384fcf7-1faa-4794-98e2-de4e505d173a.jpg?v=1742416360"},{"product_id":"wireless-gaming-headphones-in-nocturne-and-lake-blue","title":"WIRELESS GAMING HEADPHONES IN NOCTURNE \u0026 LAKE BLUE","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your gaming experience with the Datum Dahleez Wireless Gaming Headphones. Immerse yourself in crystal-clear audio and hear every detail with custom Beryllium drivers and exceptional acoustics with independent volume controls for mic and game so you won't miss a move. The detachable boom microphone and internal mic array provide exceptional talk quality even when the boom mic is detached, allowing for optimal communication in a sophisticated, flexible design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from premium materials, the lightweight magnesium ear cups paired with cushioned lambskin leather pads, an Alcantara®-lined inner headband for enhanced grip, and a coated canvas outer headband offer unparalleled comfort during play and a wear that only gets better with time. Plus, for longer playtime, on-head detection preserves the battery life of your wireless gaming headphones.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay online for longer and get to 50% battery life in only 30 minutes of charging. Use the low-latency adapter to eliminate audio delays and effortlessly switch between your PC and console with convenient plug and play. An optional USB-C to 3.5mm analog connection for other compatible consoles provides added versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":49344133923163,"sku":"MG20BGT2","price":650.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/a22_1_9a1091e5-ab51-4c21-8de4-8469bbe75f91.jpg?v=1742416359"}],"url":"https:\/\/Datum Dahleez.store\/collections\/tech.oembed","provider":"Datum Dahleez STORE","version":"1.0","type":"link"}